      "title": {
        "en": "Writing desk",
        "zh": "写作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A left-sidebar entry: clicking it opens a writing-desk conversation in the current workspace (agent preset “Writing desk”). The desk's project rules, angle draw, dedup and archiving follow only conversations started from it; ordinary conversations get a single signpost pointing at the tab and carry neither the protocol nor the deskcore tools. Configure the address and key with /desk-setup, then just talk.",
        "zh": "左侧栏的一个入口：点一下就在当前工作区开一个写作台对话（智能体预设「写作台」）。写作台的项目规则、发文坐标、查重和存档只跟着从它开的对话走；普通对话里只有一句「写品牌小红书内容请走写作台」的指路，没有协议也没有 deskcore 的工具。地址和钥匙用 /desk-setup 配置，对话里照常说话就行。"
      },
